From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Thibaut Lapierre <root@epheo.eu>
Date: Fri, 6 Nov 2026 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 10/13] ovn: enable multi-networkpolicy

enable-multi-networkpolicy=true, the MultiNetworkPolicy CRD in
MicroShift's CRD list so it exists before OVN-K starts, and the
controller's rights to watch it. Needs 0001.

The CRD file itself is not carried: the SRPM stage writes
assets/crd/multi-networkpolicy.crd.yaml from the payload's
cluster-network-operator (src/image/payload-crds.sh), so it always matches
the OVN-K that ships with it. A tree built with scripts/patches.sh tree
lacks it until that script runs.

Covered by: vm-test (a MultiNetworkPolicy cuts a pod off the layer2
network and its removal restores it).
---
 assets/components/ovn/common/clusterrole-controller.yaml | 9 +++++++++
 assets/components/ovn/common/configmap.yaml              | 1 +
 pkg/assets/crd.go                                        | 1 +
 3 files changed, 11 insertions(+)

diff --git a/assets/components/ovn/common/clusterrole-controller.yaml b/assets/components/ovn/common/clusterrole-controller.yaml
index 8568a7ad46b2c232efef031994239a9635b70de5..f4781f611f20e6a5e978f19cebc56a716e9c02bc 100644
--- a/assets/components/ovn/common/clusterrole-controller.yaml
+++ b/assets/components/ovn/common/clusterrole-controller.yaml
@@ -144,3 +144,12 @@ rules:
   - create
   - update
   - patch
+# enable-multi-networkpolicy adds these to the same startup list: forbidden
+# here crash-loops ovnkube-controller and the node never goes Ready.
+- apiGroups: ["k8s.cni.cncf.io"]
+  resources:
+  - multi-networkpolicies
+  verbs:
+  - get
+  - list
+  - watch
diff --git a/assets/components/ovn/common/configmap.yaml b/assets/components/ovn/common/configmap.yaml
index d83bc16195b45c68224bf620c1225e80c97b3006..aff3f37e75d682e740a11421a2720b14c7801ae6 100644
--- a/assets/components/ovn/common/configmap.yaml
+++ b/assets/components/ovn/common/configmap.yaml
@@ -30,6 +30,7 @@ data:
     enable-egress-firewall=false
     enable-egress-qos=false
     enable-multi-network=true
+    enable-multi-networkpolicy=true
 
     [gateway]
     mode=local
diff --git a/pkg/assets/crd.go b/pkg/assets/crd.go
index 80c69cd559b13bb0ad6dd044516adbe53e551cf9..23df1392d149b0b5c2c51beaebf449edd8a6732f 100644
--- a/pkg/assets/crd.go
+++ b/pkg/assets/crd.go
@@ -39,6 +39,7 @@ var (
 		"crd/0000_03_config-operator_01_securitycontextconstraints.crd.yaml",
 		"crd/route.crd.yaml",
 		"crd/storage_version_migration.crd.yaml",
+		"crd/multi-networkpolicy.crd.yaml",
 		"components/lvms/topolvm.io_logicalvolumes.yaml",
 		"components/lvms/lvm.topolvm.io_lvmclusters.yaml",
 		"components/lvms/lvm.topolvm.io_lvmvolumegroupnodestatuses.yaml",
